### ============================================================
### Day3-3 動作確認用：迷子ペット登録 → 発見ペット登録 → マッチング実行
### ============================================================

### ① owner権限でログイン
# @name ownerLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/test-login?role=owner

###

### ② 迷子ペットの写真をアップロード
# @name lostPhotoUpload
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/photos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoib3duZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgxNzQ2MjV9.rYCYPi1OVC5QwdWwkYAtBeI-kdlMp3Xw3JvXvB61gC4
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ③ 迷子ペット本体を登録（/pets/lost）
# ★修正：photoUrl(単数) → photoUrls(配列)に変更。モデル側がList<String>を要求するようになったため、
# 1枚しかなくても配列 [ ] で囲んで送る必要がある
# @name lostPetRegister
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/lost
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoib3duZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgxNzQ2MjV9.rYCYPi1OVC5QwdWwkYAtBeI-kdlMp3Xw3JvXvB61gC4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photoUrls": ["https://cdjilctcmrzyijttaqnu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/pet-photos/b8f2e97f-852e-4c6a-b74d-5eb68a018643_test.jpg"],
  "phoneNumber": "090-1234-5678",
  "specie": "柴犬",
  "color": "茶色",
  "other": "赤い首輪をしていた",
  "lostPlace": "石川県 輪島市 ○○町"
}

###

### ④ finder権限でログイン
# @name finderLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/test-login?role=finder

###

### ⑤ 発見ペットの写真をアップロード
# @name foundPhotoUpload
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/photos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoiZmluZGVyIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg4MTc0NjY4fQ.NFd4ubeq1sAxIsvWKcvzFjsDwex0NjIDDBzhCI6yPXg
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ⑥ 発見ペット本体を登録（/pets/found）
# ★修正：photoUrl(単数) → photoUrls(配列)に変更
# @name foundPetRegister
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/found
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoiZmluZGVyIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg4MTc0NjY4fQ.NFd4ubeq1sAxIsvWKcvzFjsDwex0NjIDDBzhCI6yPXg
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photoUrls": ["https://cdjilctcmrzyijttaqnu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/pet-photos/be0b3e8c-1a2f-4a7a-aab0-ab8086fd665b_test.jpg"],
  "foundPlace": "石川県 輪島市 ○○町",
  "foundDate": "2026-08-24T09:30:00",
  "specie": "柴犬",
  "color": "茶色",
  "other": "人懐っこい"
}

###

### ⑦ マッチング実行！（本命）
POST http://localhost:8080/matching/run?lostPetId={{lostPetRegister.response.body.$.id}}